---
import Button from "../foundation/Button.astro";
import { howItWorksProof } from "../../data/how-it-works";
---
<section class="hiw-hero container" aria-labelledby="hiw-title"><div class="hiw-hero__copy"><p class="hiw-kicker">How Chakusa works</p><h1 id="hiw-title">From the first enquiry to the next visit.</h1><p>Chakusa connects customer discovery, enquiries, bookings, follow-ups, reviews, and repeat visits in one continuous workflow, so nothing about a customer relationship gets lost between steps.</p><div class="hiw-hero__actions"><Button href="/get-started">Start free</Button><Button href="#hiw-journey" variant="secondary">See the full journey</Button></div><dl class="hiw-hero__proof">{howItWorksProof.map((item) => <div><dt>{item.label}</dt><dd>{item.value}</dd></div>)}</dl></div><ol class="hiw-hero__path" aria-label="The Chakusa customer journey, from discovery to return visit"><li>Discover</li><li>Enquire</li><li>Book</li><li>Serve</li><li>Review</li><li>Return</li></ol></section>
